// ---- README.md ----
/*
# File Organizer

Organize files in a directory by their extension.

## Installation

```bash
cargo install file-organizer
```

## Usage

```bash
# Organize the current directory
file-organizer

# Organize a specific directory
file-organizer /path/to/directory

# Verbose output
file-organizer -v

# Dry run (preview changes)
file-organizer -n
```

## Example

```bash
$ ls
file1.txt  file2.txt  script.rs  README.md

$ file-organizer

$ ls
txt/  rs/  md/

$ ls txt/
file1.txt  file2.txt
```

## License

MIT OR Apache-2.0
*/

